      "writtenOn": "2022-08-30T04:01:28Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "What would you think of adding a footnote to this column that reiterates that these EKU descriptions apply to existing CAs, not new applicants? I got momentarily confused because the sentence above says \"Both applicant CAs and those with certificates already included...\" and yet this column doesn\u0027t describe applicant CAs.",
